# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Never commit real values.
#
# Wishes garden (optional). Without these the guestbook runs in a clearly
# labelled preview mode that keeps wishes on the guest's own device only.
# Use the project's *anon* / *publishable* key — NEVER the service-role key.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key

# Public URL of the deployed site. Makes WhatsApp / social link previews
# use an absolute image URL. Also set `siteUrl` in src/config/wedding.ts.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://your-wedding-site.vercel.app
